# Dependencies and private runtimes
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/.venv-*/
**/site-packages/

# Generated builds and caches
**/dist/
**/构建成品/
**/coverage/
**/.runtime/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest-tmp*/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime data and evidence
**/artifacts/
**/data/
**/命令验证输出/
**/GUI真实联调截图/
**/真实浏览器步骤截图/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/*.log
**/*.zip

# Secrets, sessions, and machine-specific metadata
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.dpapi
**/storage-state*.json
**/.openai/

# Nested repository metadata is backed up outside this repository
**/.git/
